{"title":"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 49","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_49\">Problem 49</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_49&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 49\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For the infinite series <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/0/d70e5b79e08d5c0f2fb1ca9c570eb10327c007c8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1-\\frac12-\\frac14+\\frac18-\\frac{1}{16}-\\frac{1}{32}+\\frac{1}{64}-\\frac{1}{128}-\\cdots$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"343\" height=\"37\" /> let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> be the (limiting) sum. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> equals:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/3/ca32dc72d89ffae977bb5e983d5e1a3b7d2de045.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 0\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\frac27\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac67\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac{9}{32}\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\frac{27}{32}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"381\" height=\"37\" />  \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_49&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Notice that we can arrange the sequence like so: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/6/3e6f4563c0c964ccbc5e1f33e3d00c30cc9926d6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*}1-\\frac12-\\frac14+\\frac18-\\frac{1}{16}-\\frac{1}{32}+\\frac{1}{64}-\\frac{1}{128}-\\cdots  &amp;= 1-\\frac{5}{8}-\\frac{5}{64}-\\frac{5}{512}-\\dots \\\\ &amp;= 1-\\left(\\sum_{i=1}^{\\infty}\\frac{5}{8^n}\\right) \\\\ &amp;= 1-\\frac{5}{7} \\text{ (by the convergence of a geometric series)} \\\\ &amp;=\\frac{2}{7}\\end{align*}\" width=\"720\" height=\"183\" />\nhence our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/c/13c3218ca790f4eac4048f34f68433655b19e1f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{B}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_49&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME\" title=\"1959 AHSME\">1959 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1959 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1959\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_48\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 48\">Problem 48</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_50\"